{"id":"c85b541d1392c84ed30c9f6310b03af6eee513b6","axis":"silent","repo":"grafana/loki","sha":"c85b541d1392c84ed30c9f6310b03af6eee513b6","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/sources/shared/configuration.md","lines":["@@ -1255,6 +1255,21 @@ dataobj:","       # CLI flag: -dataobj.compaction.scheduler.endpoint","       [endpoint: <string> | default = \"/api/v2/compaction-frame\"]"," ","+    deletion_sweep:","+      # Experimental: Sweep each tenant once an hour and record its objects in","+      # its deletion file list. Only tenants with the","+      # dataobj_deletion_sweep_enabled limit","+      # (-dataobj-compaction.deletion-sweep.enable) set to true are swept.","+      # Requires dataobj compaction to be enabled.","+      # CLI flag: -dataobj.compaction.deletion-sweep.enabled","+      [enabled: <boolean> | default = false]","+","+      # Experimental: Maximum number of deletion sweeps that run at the same","+      # time, across all tenants. Each sweep scans the uncompacted objects of","+      # the whole bucket.","+      # CLI flag: -dataobj.compaction.deletion-sweep.max-concurrent-sweeps","+      [max_concurrent_sweeps: <int> | default = 4]","+","     worker:","       # Experimental: Number of task-execution threads. 0 uses GOMAXPROCS.","       # CLI flag: -dataobj.compaction.worker.worker-threads","@@ -4611,6 +4626,11 @@ shard_streams:"," # CLI flag: -dataobj-compaction.log.enable"," [dataobj_log_compaction_enabled: <boolean> | default = false]"," ","+# Experimental. Whether the dataobj deletion sweep runs for the tenant. The","+# sweep also needs -dataobj.compaction.deletion-sweep.enabled.","+# CLI flag: -dataobj-compaction.deletion-sweep.enable","+[dataobj_deletion_sweep_enabled: <boolean> | default = false]","+"," # Deprecated: Bloom planning strategy to use in bloom creation. Can be one of:"," # 'split_keyspace_by_factor', 'split_by_series_chunks_size'"," # CLI flag: -bloom-build.planning-strategy"],"additions":20,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pkg/dataobj/deletion/scanner.go","lines":["@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ import ("," \t\"golang.org/x/sync/errgroup\""," "," \t\"github.com/grafana/loki/v3/pkg/dataobj\"","+\t\"github.com/grafana/loki/v3/pkg/dataobj/metastore\""," )"," "," // MinObjectAge is the minimum age of an object that List returns. Objects are","@@ -33,21 +34,19 @@ const MinObjectAge = time.Hour"," // FileListScanner is safe for concurrent use."," type FileListScanner struct {"," \tbucket       objstore.BucketReader","-\tindexPrefix  string"," \tmaxOpenFiles int"," \tlogger       log.Logger"," }"," "," // NewFileListScanner returns a FileListScanner for bucket. bucket is the root","-// of the data object storage, which holds the objects/ directory. indexPrefix","-// is the path of the index storage relative to bucket, for example","-// \"index/v0\".","+// of the data object storage, which holds the objects/ directory and the","+// index storage at [metastore.IndexStoragePrefix]."," //"," // maxOpenFiles limits the number of objects that List opens at the same time."," //"," // NewFileListScanner returns an error if maxOpenFiles is less than 1, or if"," // bucket does not report modification times with [objstore.WithUpdatedAt].","-func NewFileListScanner(bucket objstore.BucketReader, indexPrefix string, maxOpenFiles int, logger log.Logger) (*FileListScanner, error) {","+func NewFileListScanner(bucket objstore.BucketReader, maxOpenFiles int, logger log.Logger) (*FileListScanner, error) {"," \tif maxOpenFiles < 1 {"," \t\treturn nil, fmt.Errorf(\"max open files must be at least 1, got %d\", maxOpenFiles)"," \t}","@@ -56,7 +55,6 @@ func NewFileListScanner(bucket objstore.BucketReader, indexPrefix string, maxOpe"," \t}"," \treturn &FileListScanner{"," \t\tbucket:       bucket,","-\t\tindexPrefix:  strings.Trim(indexPrefix, objstore.DirDelim),"," \t\tmaxOpenFiles: maxOpenFiles,"," \t\tlogger:       logger,"," \t}, nil","@@ -70,11 +68,11 @@ func NewFileListScanner(bucket objstore.BucketReader, indexPrefix string, ma